# Direct runtime dependencies of the sidecar + compliance engine, EXACT pins.
# Human-edited. The locks are generated from this file - never edit them by hand:
#   requirements-windows.txt   the packaged build (Windows, Python 3.11)
#   requirements-linux.txt     CI test suites (Linux, Python 3.12)
# Regenerate after changing a pin: see the header of either lock.
# Versions = what the last green Windows build installed (run 39300596200,
# 2026-10-19). Bumps arrive monthly as a Dependabot PR; never auto-merged.
# tests/test_dependency_lock.py fails on any unpinned line or an out-of-sync lock.

